{"id":"wb-6-407","name":"清虚观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清虚观","text":"清虚观是一座大型道教建筑群，位于中华人民共和国山西省平遥县县城古城街道东大街109号，古城下东门内，距离平遥城墙的下东门（亲翰门）仅有100米。平遥县博物馆设于此处。观内已无道士修行。已列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E8%99%9A%E8%A7%82","revisionId":93654161,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93654161","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/256ea8870570f157accc8bcd.jpg","title":"Pingyao_Qingxu_Guan_2013.08.25_08-22-08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pingyao_Qingxu_Guan_2013.08.25_08-22-08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/Pingyao_Qingxu_Guan_2013.08.25_08-22-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"平遥清虚观 ——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}